WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:14.657
looked at the city streets below.

2
00:00:16.038 --> 00:00:19.220
She saw lines of robots moving about like ants in a colony.

3
00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:21.321
Cozlin bit her lip.

4
00:00:22.282 --> 00:00:23.663
Roxy could tell she was scared.

5
00:00:23.683 --> 00:00:25.765
"This is fine!"

6
00:00:26.165 --> 00:00:27.286
Cozlin said suddenly.

7
00:00:27.306 --> 00:00:29.968
"We can definitely handle it."

8
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:35.691
She flew the spaceship close to a large building covered in robots, and gulped.

9
00:00:36.452 --> 00:00:38.554
"What is that place?"

10
00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:39.675
Roxy asked.

11
00:00:39.695 --> 00:00:42.877
"King Radnik's palace."

12
00:00:43.778 --> 00:00:45.719
Cozlin picked up a communication device.

13
00:00:45.739 --> 00:00:48.201
"This is Kid Comet!

14
00:00:48.562 --> 00:00:50.523
I'm trying to reach King Radnik."

15
00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:52.425
There was no answer.

16
00:00:52.445 --> 00:00:55.007
"Uh-oh," Roxy thought.

17
00:00:56.048 --> 00:00:58.409
Finally a voice came through the communication device.

18
00:00:58.429 --> 00:01:01.432
"King Radnik is in an underground bunker.

19
00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:02.837
I'll send you the location."

20
00:01:04.638 --> 00:01:06.499
Cozlin let out a huge sigh of relief.

21
00:01:14.303 --> 00:01:18.065
Soon the spaceship arrived at two large metal doors in the side of a grassy hill.

22
00:01:19.126 --> 00:01:21.507
The doors opened, and the spaceship flew in.

23
00:01:21.527 --> 00:01:25.769
"I'm glad you're back, Kid Comet!"

24
00:01:26.249 --> 00:01:27.090
King Radnik said.

25
00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:28.891
He looked at Roxy.

26
00:01:28.911 --> 00:01:30.632
"Thank you for coming.

27
00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.082
Those robots are causing a lot of trouble."

28
00:01:34.102 --> 00:01:40.568
"I'm happy to help, King, um, Your Majesty," Roxy said.

29
00:01:42.009 --> 00:01:45.192
They went into a meeting room where a screen displayed a map of the capital.

30
00:01:46.093 --> 00:01:47.914
Government officials hurried back and forth.

31
00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:52.438
"We're planning an evacuation," King Radnik said.

32
00:01:52.458 --> 00:01:56.241
"I want every Delkorian off the planet as fast as possible.

33
00:01:56.862 --> 00:01:58.964
And I want to know where those robots came from.

34
00:02:00.548 --> 00:02:01.168
Who sent them?

35
00:02:01.428 --> 00:02:02.269
Why are they here?"

36
00:02:03.849 --> 00:02:04.609
Cozlin nodded.

37
00:02:04.629 --> 00:02:06.490
"I'll figure it out!"

38
00:02:06.510 --> 00:02:09.571
"We both will," Roxy said.

39
00:02:10.411 --> 00:02:11.511
Cozlin glanced at her.

40
00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.692
"Right! We both will."

41
00:02:18.453 --> 00:02:20.834
Cozlin landed her spaceship just outside the city.

42
00:02:23.734 --> 00:02:25.815
Roxy watched the robots move around the streets.

43
00:02:26.755 --> 00:02:29.076
Every robot had the letter M stamped on it.

44
00:02:30.668 --> 00:02:34.029
"I wonder what that M stands for," Roxy said.

45
00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:37.630
"Who cares," Cozlin said.

46
00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.131
Zap! She blasted a robot.

47
00:02:42.391 --> 00:02:46.512
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams blew apart another robot.

48
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:49.733
One robot pointed at Roxy and Cozlin.

49
00:02:49.753 --> 00:02:52.574
"Destroy them!"

50
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:56.515
Robots stomped toward the two superheroes.

51
00:02:56.535 --> 00:03:01.309
"Uh-oh!" Roxy flew fast.

52
00:03:02.550 --> 00:03:05.192
She darted away from one robot and smashed another.

53
00:03:07.054 --> 00:03:13.419
Cozlin zipped back and forth, blasting robots that tried to grab her.

54
00:03:13.439 --> 00:03:16.302
As Roxy flew, she saw a robot chomping on a vehicle.

55
00:03:17.183 --> 00:03:20.125
The robot hummed and then another robot popped out of its back.

56
00:03:24.549 --> 00:03:28.012
Whiz-hoo! She blasted the first robot, and it blew up.

57
00:03:29.024 --> 00:03:30.245
Then Roxy gasped.

58
00:03:30.265 --> 00:03:33.867
The second robot fell over, lifeless.

59
00:03:34.928 --> 00:03:35.949
Cozlin saw it too.

60
00:03:35.969 --> 00:03:38.110
"Rocket Girl!"

61
00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:38.911
she said.

62
00:03:38.931 --> 00:03:42.173
"We need to destroy the first robot that came here!

63
00:03:42.493 --> 00:03:44.715
Then maybe all the others will stop working!"

64
00:03:48.637 --> 00:03:50.939
The two of them blasted one robot after another.

65
00:03:51.779 --> 00:03:52.800
But it didn't seem to help.

66
00:03:53.861 --> 00:03:55.522
Robots were still everywhere!

67
00:03:56.923 --> 00:03:58.424
Roxy and Cozlin were exhausted.

68
00:04:01.112 --> 00:04:03.334
They flew out of the city and flopped on the ground.

69
00:04:03.354 --> 00:04:07.438
"This is awful!"

70
00:04:07.878 --> 00:04:08.579
Cozlin said.

71
00:04:08.599 --> 00:04:10.941
"What am I going to do?"

72
00:04:10.961 --> 00:04:16.065
"You mean, what are we going to do," Roxy said.

73
00:04:16.085 --> 00:04:19.648
"Don't forget—you dragged me into this.

74
00:04:20.609 --> 00:04:22.791
You said it would just take an hour or two!"

75
00:04:25.493 --> 00:04:26.734
Cozlin sat up suddenly.

76
00:04:26.754 --> 00:04:28.676
"Did you hear that?"

77
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:31.269
Roxy scratched her head.

78
00:04:31.289 --> 00:04:35.131
"Huh?" "Someone's here," Cozlin said.

79
00:04:36.632 --> 00:04:39.474
Roxy saw an alien peeking over a nearby boulder.

80
00:04:40.714 --> 00:04:43.196
He gasped, ran to a scooter, and zoomed away.
